# Coding and tests

Authoritative: [docs/ARCHITECTURE.md](../../docs/ARCHITECTURE.md), [docs/05-qa-plan.md](../../docs/05-qa-plan.md), [README.md](../../README.md).

## Conventions

- Namespaces / asmdefs: follow this game’s architecture (TODO if not documented).
- Prefer simple composition. No speculative packages without approval.
- Match existing style in the files you touch; avoid drive-by refactors.

## Testing

- Prefer **Edit Mode** Unity Test Framework tests for pure logic.
- Play Mode only when input/scene lifetime truly requires it.
- Validate with `scripts/validate.sh` when the Editor is not locking the project; otherwise use the in-Editor Test Runner and report that batchmode was blocked.
- Never claim tests passed without actually running them.
- Do not treat custom reflection runners as equivalent to Unity Test Framework.
